            <ArticleTitle>Double congenital patella: case report and review of the literature.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>566-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a case of double congenital patella, which is a rare finding. This anomaly was studied using radiography, CT and MR. Magnetic resonance imaging has enabled us to make an accurate anatomical evaluation of the double congenital patella.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
